---
import { currentChapter } from "../data/currentChapter";
import SectionHeader from "./SectionHeader.astro";
const { education, venture } = currentChapter;
---
<section id="current-chapter" class="section section-soft"><div class="shell">
  <SectionHeader eyebrow="03 / The current chapter" title="Learning by building. Now, in India." description="Independent exploration brought me here. Studying and building with a team is shaping what comes next." />
  <div class="chapter-grid">
    <article class="education-card"><div class="row"><p class="label">Education in progress</p><span class="tag">{education.cohort}</span></div><h3>{education.institution}</h3><p class="education-degree">{education.degree}</p><p class="small muted">{education.period} · {education.term}</p><p class="education-summary">{education.summary}</p><ul class="tags" aria-label="Current learning focus">{education.focus.map(item => <li class="tag">{item}</li>)}</ul></article>
    <div class="chapter-note"><p class="eyebrow">From the classroom to the product</p><h3>A different environment.<br /><span class="serif">A shared ambition.</span></h3><p>Working with a three-person team adds a new dimension: defining a shared problem, making technical trade-offs and turning research into something we can test.</p><p class="small">{venture.role}<br />AdrenLabs / Adren.ai</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="#adren-ai">See the venture <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><span class="label">Updated {currentChapter.updated}</span></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
